    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d531">

                <pb facs="0670" n="550" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg550"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890f.01/33</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dawes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-14">April 14, 1931</date>.<lb/>[Received April
                        22.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1832</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my cablegram No. 107, April
                    14, 4 p.m.,<anchor n="11" xml:id="d531-f1"/> and previous correspondence
                    concerning the question of extending the formal recognition of the United States
                    Government to the Kingdom of the Hedjaz and Nejd and its Dependencies, I have
                    the honor to transmit herewith a copy of the memorandum handed me this morning
                    by the Minister of the Hedjaz and Nejd in reply to the memorandum <pb
                        facs="0671" n="551" xml:id="pg551"/> given by me to him on March 5, 1931, a
                    copy of which was forwarded with the Embassy’s despatch No. 1808, April 1,
                        1931.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d531-f2"/></p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>For the Ambassador:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Benjamin Thaw,
                            Jr.</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">First Secretary of
                        Embassy</hi></closer>


                <xi:include href="d531-a1.xml" xpointer="d531-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
